        "created_at": "2018-11-21T21:51:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes, you can find it with the Wager Master ruling in regards to Breaking the Rules. &nbsp; In that case your turn order is set as Draw, power, and play so you draw two cards to start your turn. &nbsp;That ruling is posted in Fireside Chats and collected here&nbsp;<a href=\"https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Wager_Master/Clarifications\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://sentinelswiki.com/index.php?title=Wager_Master/Clarifications</a></p>",
